---
title: Résumé
layout: home
description: A real CV — a profile header on a pattern, the summary and the career timeline at seventy percent, the facts at thirty. Prints as it reads.
eyebrow: Pages
source: src/components/pages.css
---
<section class="im-section im-wrap" style="padding-top: 1.5rem; --im-section-gap: 1.5rem">
	<p class="im-eyebrow">Pages · {{page.title}}</p>
	<p class="im-lede">{{page.description}}</p>
	<p class="doc-source"><code>{{page.source}}</code></p>
</section>

<div class="im-wrap-wide im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: 2rem">
	<header class="im-cv-head">
		<span class="im-cv-pattern im-bg-blueprint im-bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
		{{> "components/avatar" size="xl" src=demo.author.profile_image name=demo.author.name}}
		<div>
			<h1 class="im-cv-name">{{demo.author.name}}</h1>
			<p class="im-cv-role">Salesforce consultant · design systems · Amsterdam</p>
			<p class="im-cv-contact"><span>{{icon "mail"}}hello@imswarnil.com</span><span>{{icon "globe"}}imswarnil.com</span><span>{{icon "brand-github"}}imswarnil</span><span>{{icon "map-pin"}}Amsterdam, NL</span></p>
		</div>
		<p class="im-cluster" style="--im-cluster-gap: .5rem"><a class="im-btn im-btn-primary im-btn-sm" href="#">{{icon "download"}}PDF</a><a class="im-btn im-btn-sm" href="/pages/contact/">Contact</a></p>
	</header>

	<div class="im-cv">
		<article>
			<section class="im-cv-section">
				<h2>Summary</h2>
				<p class="im-cv-summary">Eight years delivering Salesforce for public-sector teams, the last four independently. I take on the programmes that are already late, leave every one with a document a stranger can act on, and tell roughly a third of first conversations that they do not need me. On the side I built and sell a design system, and write a letter every fortnight about what things cost.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="im-cv-section">
				<h2>Career</h2>
				<ol class="im-timeline im-timeline-big" style="--im-timeline-gap: 1.75rem">
					<li class="im-timeline-item" data-kind="job" data-state="current"><span class="im-timeline-marker">{{icon "briefcase"}}</span><time class="im-timeline-time">2022 — now</time><h3 class="im-timeline-title">Independent consultant</h3><p class="im-timeline-text">Public sector, mostly. Two days a week, six weeks at a time. Inherited orgs nobody documented; documented them.</p></li>
					<li class="im-timeline-item" data-kind="job" data-state="done"><span class="im-timeline-marker">{{icon "briefcase"}}</span><time class="im-timeline-time">2018 — 2022</time><h3 class="im-timeline-title">Senior consultant, a Salesforce partner</h3><p class="im-timeline-text">Delivery lead on three multi-year programmes. Learned what not to do, at scale, on somebody else's budget.</p></li>
					<li class="im-timeline-item" data-kind="job" data-state="done"><span class="im-timeline-marker">{{icon "rocket"}}</span><time class="im-timeline-time">2016 — 2018</time><h3 class="im-timeline-title">Co-founder, a clinic CRM</h3><p class="im-timeline-text">The market was real; our timing was not.</p></li>
					<li class="im-timeline-item" data-kind="learning" data-state="done"><span class="im-timeline-marker">{{icon "graduation-cap"}}</span><time class="im-timeline-time">2012 — 2016</time><h3 class="im-timeline-title">B.Tech, Computer Science</h3><p class="im-timeline-text">A degree I do not use, from a college I liked.</p></li>
				</ol>
			</section>

			<section class="im-cv-section">
				<h2>Projects</h2>
				<div class="im-repos" style="--im-repos-min: 16rem">{{#each demo.projects}}{{#match @index "<" 2}}{{> "components/repo-card"}}{{/match}}{{/each}}</div>
			</section>

			<section class="im-cv-section">
				<h2>Talks & teaching</h2>
				<div class="im-resume-role"><span class="im-resume-when">2026</span><b>Design tokens, properly</b><small>A seven-lesson course · 1,240 students</small></div>
				<div class="im-resume-role"><span class="im-resume-when">2021</span><b>Why your Ghost theme fights you</b><small>Forty minutes, a conference in Berlin</small></div>
			</section>
			<section class="im-cv-section">
				<h2>Writing</h2>
				<div class="im-resume-role"><span class="im-resume-when">2019 — now</span><b>Field Notes</b><small>A letter every fortnight · 4,210 readers · 42 issues</small></div>
				<div class="im-resume-role"><span class="im-resume-when">2023 — now</span><b>The channel</b><small>Films about roads, tools and what things cost · 128k subscribers</small></div>
			</section>
			<section class="im-cv-section">
				<h2>Education</h2>
				<div class="im-resume-role"><span class="im-resume-when">2012 — 2016</span><b>B.Tech, Computer Science</b><small>A degree I do not use, from a college I liked.</small></div>
			</section>
			<section class="im-cv-section">
				<h2>Said about the work</h2>
				<div class="im-reviews">{{#each demo.testimonials}}{{#match @index "<" 2}}<article class="im-review"><p class="im-review-head"><span class="im-review-by">{{by}}</span><time class="im-review-when">{{role}}</time></p><p class="im-review-text">{{text}}</p></article>{{/match}}{{/each}}</div>
			</section>
		</article>

		<aside class="im-cv-side">
			<div><h3>Skills</h3><div class="im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: .5rem"><p class="im-cv-bar"><span>Salesforce</span><span style="--im-bar: 95%"></span></p><p class="im-cv-bar"><span>Design systems</span><span style="--im-bar: 85%"></span></p><p class="im-cv-bar"><span>CSS / Tailwind</span><span style="--im-bar: 90%"></span></p><p class="im-cv-bar"><span>Ghost themes</span><span style="--im-bar: 80%"></span></p><p class="im-cv-bar"><span>Writing</span><span style="--im-bar: 75%"></span></p></div></div>
			<div><h3>Certifications</h3><ul><li>Application Architect (2024)</li><li>Platform Developer II</li><li>Sales & Service Cloud Consultant</li></ul></div>
			<div><h3>Languages</h3><ul><li>English — fluent</li><li>Hindi — native</li><li>Dutch — A2</li></ul></div>
			<div><h3>Tools</h3><p class="im-skills">{{#each demo.projects.[0].stack}}<span class="im-tag">{{icon this.icon}}{{this.name}}</span>{{/each}}</p></div>
			<div><h3>Availability</h3><ul><li>Two days a week from November</li><li>Remote, or Amsterdam</li></ul></div>
			<div><h3>Interests</h3><ul><li>Diving, freediving</li><li>Long roads, slowly</li><li>Cameras I can carry</li></ul></div>
			<div><h3>References</h3><ul><li>On request — two clients, one partner</li></ul></div>
		</aside>
	</div>
</div>
